OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers injured in
OL,4,Aunmarked car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers have been injured
OL,7,Fin a crash with a van while responding
OL,8,Fto an emergency call in an unmarked
OL,9,Fcar.
OL,11,FKent Police said the officers were in a
OL,12,Fwhite Toyota Corolla Estate on the A259
OL,13,Fin Hythe when they were involved in the
OL,14,Fcollision with a grey Peugeot Partner
OL,15,Fat 08:00 GMT on Friday.
OL,17,FThe force said the officers were using
OL,18,Fblue lights and sirens when the crash
OL,19,Fhappened near an Aldi supermarket on
OL,20,FDymchurch Road.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
